  "purpose": "Test whether official NFL club CMS year-scoped transaction pages provide a first-party historical source surface across every 2017-2021 franchise-season, as a transport-independent alternative to the already-failed NFL.com central transaction-ledger cursor pagination path. This diagnostic measures page coverage and source semantics only; it does not classify transaction text, build a player state machine, order transactions relative to kickoff, or assign game-day membership.",
